Text & Animals
cowsay: Renders an ASCII art cow that repeats whatever text string you pass to it inside a speech bubble.
lolcat: Concatenates file data or standard inputs while overlaying a bright, flashing rainbow color gradient over the characters.
fortune | cowsay | lolcat: A popular command pipeline that grabs a random, witty quote from the fortune database, passes it to the speaking cow, and turns the entire display into a rainbow.
figlet: Converts ordinary character text strings into giant, blocky ASCII art banners stretching across your display window. 

